# LightLink Architecture and Codebase Audit Report

## Overview

This folder contains a historical public architecture and codebase audit report completed by Softstack for LightLink.

LightLink is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a blockchain infrastructure and architecture security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: LightLink  
Audit type: Architecture and codebase audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

## Public Audit Report

[Architecture_Codebase_Audit_LightLink_18022023.pdf](./Architecture_Codebase_Audit_LightLink_18022023.pdf)

## Why This Folder Exists

This folder is preserved as part of Softstack’s public audit archive. It provides historical proof of completed architecture and codebase security review work for blockchain infrastructure.

## Summary

This folder is a historical reference for Softstack’s security work connected to architecture review, codebase assessment and blockchain infrastructure security.

Softstack is a Germany based Web3 security firm founded in 2017, trusted for smart contract audits, blockchain security reviews, Web3 penetration testing and digital asset risk assessments.

Learn more about Softstack smart contract audits: https://softstack.io/smart-contract-audit/
